00:17:03,660 --> 00:17:04,780
Definitely first stage

238
00:17:04,780 --> 00:17:08,380
That's some remarkable water magic you have

239
00:17:08,940 --> 00:17:11,340
If you aren't holding back, then I won't either

240
00:17:13,100 --> 00:17:14,620
What kind of spell is this?

241
00:17:26,540 --> 00:17:28,700
I'm sorry for treating you so roughly

242
00:17:29,420 --> 00:17:31,260
But I must protect my country

243
00:17:31,820 --> 00:17:33,420
And it has need of your devil

244
00:17:35,420 --> 00:17:37,580
Where the heck did that weird bubble take me?

245
00:17:38,860 --> 00:17:41,100
Is that the heart kingdom's queen talking?

246
00:17:41,100 --> 00:17:41,900
Because if so

247
00:17:44,700 --> 00:17:45,100
Stop!

248
00:17:51,980 --> 00:17:53,740
His attribute is lightning?

249
00:17:53,740 --> 00:17:56,140
Then what's the deal with those runes he makes?

250
00:17:56,140 --> 00:17:59,420
It looks like he's using a type of magic unique to the heart kingdom

251
00:17:59,420 --> 00:18:00,940
Lightning magic

252
00:18:00,940 --> 00:18:02,060
Tengiolia

253
00:18:02,060 --> 00:18:06,220
It's fast, but my Valkyrie armor is faster

254
00:18:06,220 --> 00:18:08,540
She truly is a first stage

255
00:18:09,100 --> 00:18:09,340
But

256
00:18:10,700 --> 00:18:12,140
My spell has orders

257
00:18:12,140 --> 00:18:14,620
It will give pursuit until it strikes its target

258
00:18:25,100 --> 00:18:26,060
Please, Gaja!

259
00:18:26,060 --> 00:18:27,500
Bring our friend back right now!

260
00:18:28,140 --> 00:18:30,540
Refuse and we'll have no recourse but to fight!

261
00:18:30,860 --> 00:18:31,740
An attack spell

262
00:18:32,300 --> 00:18:35,180
It seems Lady Mimosa has become a third stage herself

263
00:18:35,740 --> 00:18:37,420
As for the Spatial Mage

264
00:18:37,420 --> 00:18:40,780
It looks like he can make a portal between any two points he has sight of

265
00:18:41,340 --> 00:18:45,180
Allow me to show you a brief glimpse of the difference in our strength

266
00:18:45,180 --> 00:18:50,300
He cast it into the sky?

267
00:18:56,460 --> 00:18:57,820
So much power

268
00:18:57,820 --> 00:19:03,660
Nature itself supplies me with mana

269
00:19:03,660 --> 00:19:05,260
No human can match its might

270
00:19:18,540 --> 00:19:20,460
I can't keep this up forever

271
00:19:20,460 --> 00:19:22,460
Just how much mana does this lady have?

272
00:19:23,180 --> 00:19:26,140
Besides, why are we even fighting anyway?

273
00:19:26,140 --> 00:19:27,580
So that's your Devil's power

274
00:19:28,220 --> 00:19:29,340
Magic negation

275
00:19:30,380 --> 00:19:30,780
What the?

276
00:19:36,620 --> 00:19:39,820
Abominable as that is, it also sounds quite useful

277
00:19:41,740 --> 00:19:45,100
Pleased to meet you, Devil Possessed Child from Clover

278
00:19:45,100 --> 00:19:46,940
You may address me as Undine

279
00:19:46,940 --> 00:19:51,020
I'm one of the four great spirits and I'm contracted to the Queen of the Heart Kingdom

280
00:19:52,060 --> 00:19:53,660
You are quite impressive

281
00:19:53,660 --> 00:19:55,820
But that doesn't mean you're any match for me

282
00:19:58,140 --> 00:19:59,340
Intriguing

283
00:19:59,340 --> 00:20:01,900
You don't have any magic of your own, do you?

284
00:20:01,900 --> 00:20:04,540
Why, that puts you even beneath the Ninth Stage

285
00:20:04,540 --> 00:20:06,060
The Ninth Stage?

286
00:20:06,060 --> 00:20:07,660
The heck are you talking about?

287
00:20:07,660 --> 00:20:08,940
Oh, that's right

288
00:20:08,940 --> 00:20:12,540
There isn't a system to quantify magic strength in your kingdom, is there?

289
00:20:12,540 --> 00:20:16,460
The weakest mages are of the Ninth Stage

290
00:20:16,460 --> 00:20:19,020
The Eighth are above them, and the Seventh above them

291
00:20:19,580 --> 00:20:22,540
Our system shows which mages have the most talent

292
00:20:22,540 --> 00:20:23,420
I can't move

293
00:20:23,420 --> 00:20:24,380
Or breathe

294
00:20:25,020 --> 00:20:27,020
Care to guess which stage is the highest?

295
00:20:28,060 --> 00:20:29,420
It's Stage Zero

296
00:20:29,420 --> 00:20:38,220
True lightning magic

297
00:20:38,220 --> 00:20:40,300
Muriel Astroza

298
00:20:40,300 --> 00:21:01,260
If they were still within sight, I'd be able to sense their mana

299
00:21:01,820 --> 00:21:03,420
They must have fled with Spatial Magic

300
00:21:04,140 --> 00:21:05,020
A wise choice

301
00:21:05,740 --> 00:21:07,500
But no matter where they try to hide

302
00:21:09,500 --> 00:21:11,580
He created a portal to a place you couldn't see

303
00:21:13,260 --> 00:21:14,700
Plant Creation Magic

304
00:21:14,700 --> 00:21:16,020
Magic Flower Guide

305
00:21:16,020 --> 00:21:17,580
This is Spatial Magic

306
00:21:17,580 --> 00:21:19,180
Fallen Angel Gate

307
00:21:19,180 --> 00:21:20,140
Here's the deal

308
00:21:20,140 --> 00:21:22,700
We can't just back down after watching you show off

309
00:21:24,060 --> 00:21:25,740
Water Creation Magic

310
00:21:25,740 --> 00:21:27,020
Sea Dragon's Roar

311
00:21:35,580 --> 00:21:37,020
Your system's trash

312
00:21:37,020 --> 00:21:39,580
You can't measure ability just by looking at talent

313
00:21:40,540 --> 00:21:42,220
Feeling Magic Inverse Relief

314
00:21:44,860 --> 00:21:45,900
This magic

315
00:21:45,900 --> 00:21:49,740
I'll keep my anti-magic all around me so she can't pull me in again

316
00:21:49,740 --> 00:21:52,140
I can feel a person's key just ahead of me

317
00:21:52,140 --> 00:21:53,500
And if there's a human up there

318
00:21:54,140 --> 00:21:54,940
Then there must be

319
00:21:54,940 --> 00:21:55,340
Air

320
00:22:01,180 --> 00:22:02,620
Mind if I join you?

321
00:22:15,900 --> 00:22:26,220
I can feel highly un sauve

322
00:22:30,780 --> 00:22:31,540
I forgot everything

323
00:22:35,540 --> 00:22:36,380
If you are ready to loose

324
00:22:38,540 --> 00:22:40,460
When you are going back

325
00:22:40,460 --> 00:22:41,500
I think I will do

326
00:22:41,500 --> 00:22:42,660
I don't have anything

327
00:22:44,660 --> 00:22:45,180
at any time

328
00:22:45,180 --> 00:23:15,160
We'll be right back.

329
00:23:15,180 --> 00:23:45,160
We'll be right back.

330
00:23:45,180 --> 00:23:49,580
129, The Devil Megicula, in which Queen Laura Pechka appears.

